<title>USA: LTX Corp names Roger Blethen as CEO.</title>
<headline>LTX Corp names Roger Blethen as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WESTWOOD, Mass. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>LTX Corp said on Monday that it named Roger Blethen as its chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Blethen, a founder of the company, has been president since 1994. Martin Francis, also president since 1994, had previously advised the board that he would be leaving the company.  </p>
<p>LTX Corp, which is based in Westwood, Ma, is a supplier of digital, linear, mixed signal and discrete semiconductor test equipment.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
